msgid "Q/E o flechas: pestaña · ↑/↓: desplazar · Esc: salir"
msgstr "Q/E 또는 방향키: 탭 · ↑/↓: 스크롤 · Esc: 나가기"

#. Key:	BriefingNoKey
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Briefing/TN_BriefingWidget.cpp(400)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Briefing/TN_BriefingWidget.cpp(400)
