#. Key:	ResetGameDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Pause/TN_PauseMenuWidget.cpp(2724)
#: Source/Tortunabo/Private/UI/Pause/TN_PauseMenuWidget.cpp(2724)
msgctxt "TNPause,ResetGameDesc"
